%% PRD-018 - Cross-session resolution flow (Raha / Ryan example)
%% Session A learns about Raha. Session B independently says Ryan's father is Raha.
%% The reconciler connects them without either session being aware of the other.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SA as Session_A
  participant SB as Session_B
  participant Ext as PersonExtractor
  participant Rec as ReconcilerActor
  participant Midx as MentionIndexActor
  participant RRaha as ResolutionActor_raha
  participant Ing as IngestPipeline
  participant Disk as Disk

  Note over SA: Session A describes Raha hometown and job
  SA->>Ext: turn text and context
  Ext->>Ing: memoryIntents profile facts for people/raha
  Ing->>Disk: write people/raha/profile.md
  Ext-->>Rec: MentionObserved surface Raha scope projectRoot
  SA-->>Rec: SessionSummary A

  Note over SB: Session B asserts Ryan father is Raha
  SB->>Ext: turn text and context
  Ext-->>Rec: MentionObserved mention ryan.family[0] surface Raha scope scenario
  Rec->>Midx: LookupBySurface Raha
  Midx-->>Rec: candidates people/raha alias uniq
  Rec->>RRaha: ResolveCandidate mention and people/raha

  RRaha->>RRaha: signal ensemble S1 S2 S3 S7
  RRaha->>Disk: append incoming.yaml soft edge conf 0.72
  RRaha-->>Rec: EvidenceAppended conf 0.72 state soft
  RRaha-->>Ing: IngestIntentDraft softLinkTo people/raha
  Ing->>Disk: apply validated intent to relationships.md

  SB-->>Rec: SessionSummary B
  Note over Rec: Coalesce window of about 2s ends

  Note over SA,SB: Later Session C adds attribute overlap S4
  Rec->>RRaha: ResolveCandidate same edge new signals
  RRaha->>RRaha: confidence 0.93
  RRaha->>Disk: append promotions.log.yaml from soft to hard by auto
  RRaha-->>Rec: LinkStateChanged soft to hard
  RRaha-->>Ing: IngestIntentDraft softLinkTo to entityRef
  Ing->>Disk: apply canonical update to relationships.md
